  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">방학이라 또 엉뚱한 짓을 합니다^^<br><br>쌈채소를 오랫만에 주문했어요. 받아서 냉장고에 넣는데 ‘이걸로 공변세포 관찰 가능할까? 잘 될까? 이게 가능성 있으면 실험재료의 범위가 재밌어질 수 있겠는데? (남으면 먹겠다는 생각으로 시작한 건 절.대.아.님. ㅋ) <br><br>어제 종업후 현미경 등등을 챙겨서 퇴근했습니다. <br><br>쌈채소들<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ee45371a0f72190057dc74c5983ef832a1411f91\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ee45371a0f72190057dc74c5983ef832a1411f91\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"359\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8c5140dbc965df2bcbb71a280339f672ab472a6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b8c5140dbc965df2bcbb71a280339f672ab472a6\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"466\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4ce278995afa04d36e16c72b55343c7324b427e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f4ce278995afa04d36e16c72b55343c7324b427e\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0fa9d30717bd6a7d95a3e76acbc91b57ec67bbfe\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/0fa9d30717bd6a7d95a3e76acbc91b57ec67bbfe\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eab1fe5db3468b1b8ad6255cf10054318a6580ee\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eab1fe5db3468b1b8ad6255cf10054318a6580ee\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bed5b8c95e4c99710f28acc5d10b44f6c9f9783b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/bed5b8c95e4c99710f28acc5d10b44f6c9f9783b\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e9532043b4c9f6a6f2adf410c9314795056220b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6e9532043b4c9f6a6f2adf410c9314795056220b\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8153daac3ec0fabd04d715095b1365cd301e4afb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8153daac3ec0fabd04d715095b1365cd301e4afb\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/614a94583bbbbccf3e186a33e6e6535d4a070e43\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/614a94583bbbbccf3e186a33e6e6535d4a070e43\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c36a6b9f46929a61f0b88c8842bc507e8c634c58\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c36a6b9f46929a61f0b88c8842bc507e8c634c58\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"354\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87414bfadc79243f74afb58c6320af7c06611e4b\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/87414bfadc79243f74afb58c6320af7c06611e4b\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/533aee462c0f7353a9c53c18aabc3f9e4ebcc3cb\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/533aee462c0f7353a9c53c18aabc3f9e4ebcc3cb\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">거치대를 안 가져와서 사진이 아쉽습니다. <br><br>&lt;관찰 결과&gt;<br>-1,2번만 뒷표피가 한 겹으로 제법 벗겨졌고, 다른 것들은 벗기기 많이 어려웠습니다.<br>-표피세포 모양은 거의 다 퍼즐모양. 특히 5번(로메인인 듯 아닌 듯)이 요철이 가장 확실한 퍼즐모양. <br>-공변세포 사이즈가 채소 종류별로 조금씩 다름(쌈채소 종류별로 길쭉or통통 도 다르고, 크기도 다름)<br>-잎자루쪽, 잎끄트머리쪽 공변세포 사이즈 차이 나는 듯<br><br>&lt;공변세포 실험재료로 어떤가&gt;<br>-벗기기 쉽지 않아서 학생들이 1시간짜리 실험에서 프레파라트 제작하는 건 별로. (닭의장풀이 젤 좋은 이유가 학생들도 재료 다루기 쉬워서)<br>-정규 수업 외 동아리, 행사용으로는 쓸 계획임. 보고 싶은 거 다~ 보고 비교해보기, 특이한 점 찾기 등<br><br><br>+ 꽃잎 관찰 </p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a0a16d41d8317b8d7260b57ebf2cbc6d318ee8f3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a0a16d41d8317b8d7260b57ebf2cbc6d318ee8f3\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/378b332abf9d76fc5fdda553a99fbcd60f18572c\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/378b332abf9d76fc5fdda553a99fbcd60f18572c\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f110025706af80cc8a943af9087ace1c3d41af5a\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f110025706af80cc8a943af9087ace1c3d41af5a\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a6b0d2c902c13804885fecd3e0aa7cddb55a871\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5a6b0d2c902c13804885fecd3e0aa7cddb55a871\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8dba0bd86853efdb21e6bd6ee7c3a9050daf160\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e8dba0bd86853efdb21e6bd6ee7c3a9050daf160\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"640\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><br><br>꽃잎 표피는 안 벗겨진다고 생각하고 있었는데, 딸이 이걸 벗겨냈습니다. <br>- 색소체가 보일 거라 생각했는데 안 보였구요. <br>- 세포모양이 요철있으면서 길쭉합니다. (외떡잎쪽이라 그런 거 같은데 그냥 제 생각입니다. 백합잎표피 세포모양과 유사. 꽃2는 백합과 모양이고, 꽃1은 잎이 나란히맥이었음)<br></p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
